130 models reachable from this account on 2026-09-14.

  chat           114
  other            8
  audio            5
  embeddings       3

The three this book names, and what they resolve to for you:

  MODEL_FAST   gpt-5.4-mini            reachable           no rate set — see below
               accepts: logprobs, max_completion_tokens, reasoning_effort, seed, temperature, top_p
  MODEL_SMART  gpt-5.5                 reachable           no rate set — see below
               accepts: max_completion_tokens, reasoning_effort, seed
  MODEL_EMBED  text-embedding-3-small  reachable           no rate set — see below
               accepts: dimensions

Rates are not in this book, and that is deliberate. To fill them in:

  1. Open your provider's pricing page and read the dollars per million
     tokens for each model above — input and output are different numbers.
  2. Put them in .env as RATE_<MODEL>_INPUT and RATE_<MODEL>_OUTPUT, with
     the model name upper-cased and every - and . turned into _.
  3. Re-run. Every listing in the book that reports tokens will now also
     report dollars, using your rates rather than someone's recollection.

  For gpt-5.4-mini, those two lines are:

      RATE_GPT_5_4_MINI_INPUT=0.15
      RATE_GPT_5_4_MINI_OUTPUT=0.60

  (0.15 and 0.60 are placeholders standing in for a real pricing page.
   The point is the shape of the line, not the number on it.)
